    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεμ-πίπλημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill in turn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντενέπλησαν τὴν ὁδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.4.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>fill in return, by way of compensation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.5.28
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be filled with in exchange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					705b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
